 xác suất để linh kiện điện tử đó được đóng dấu OTK với điều kiện nó không đạt tiêu chuẩn. Vậy <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>∣</mo><mover><mi>A</mi><mo accent=\"true\">¯</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>0</mn><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">,</mo><mn>95</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">,</mo><mn>05</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.</li></ul>\n\t\t\tVậy <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>⋅</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mover><mi>A</mi><mo accent=\"true\">¯</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>⋅</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>∣</mo><mover><mi>A</mi><mo accent=\"true\">¯</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">,</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>0</mn><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">,</mo><mn>99</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>0</mn><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">,</mo><mn>05</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">,</mo><mn>802</mn></mrow></semantics></math>. <br>\n\t\t\tVậy xác suất để  linh kiện điện tử đó được đóng dấu OTK là <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">,</mo><mn>802</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.</li><li>Ta có sơ đồ hình cây\n\t\t\t<div class=\"tex-center\"><figure class=\"tex-figure\"><img src=\"/bank-assets/9befe9ed21513cbca3f1934a7c445c2088df50eff46efb7ac273e15e98e6fc6b.svg\" alt=\"Hình minh họa\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"figure-zoom\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⤢</span></figure></div>\n\t\t\tCó hai nhánh cây đi từ <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mi>O</mi></semantics></math> tới <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mover><mi>B</mi><mo accent=\"true\">¯</mo></mover></semantics></math> là <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>A</mi><mover><mi>B</mi><mo accent=\"true\">¯</mo></mover></mrow></semantics></math> và <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">¯</mo></mover></mrow></semantics></math>. Vậy xác suất để linh kiện điện tử được chọn không được đóng dấu OTK là <div class=\"math-display\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mover><mi>B</mi><mo accent=\"true\">¯</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">,</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>0</mn><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">,</mo><mn>01</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>0</mn><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">,</mo><mn>95</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">,</mo><mn>198</mn><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div></li></ol>",
